```

Otherwise `contentType` is `undefined`, and `getSchemaSerializer` (`lib/schemas.js:155`) skips the media-type branch entirely.

---

## Summary of Touch Points

| File | Line | What to change |
|---|---|---|
| `lib/reply.js` | 1023 | Swap/extend the `JSON.stringify` fallback |
| `lib/schemas.js` | 144–207 | Extend `getSchemaSerializer` for binary content types |
